# PRO — Influencer Marketing ROI Analytics & ML Notebook Generator

## BUSINESS CONTEXT & PURPOSE

This skill generates a **production-grade analytics pipeline** for an Influencer Marketing ROI dataset.

**What this pipeline solves for your client:**
Brands and marketing agencies spend large budgets on influencer campaigns without a systematic
way to predict which influencers will deliver high ROI. This pipeline ingests historical campaign
data, engineers smart performance signals, trains ML models to predict high-ROI outcomes before
spend, segments influencers into tiers, and exports a decision-ready intelligence layer that
powers a SaaS dashboard — so campaign managers can pick the right influencers, at the right cost,
on the right platform, every time.

**Dataset columns and their business meaning:**

| Column | Type | Business Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `Influencer_ID` | ID | Unique influencer identifier |
| `Platform` | Categorical | Channel where campaign ran (Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, etc.) |
| `Audience_Niche` | Categorical | Content vertical / audience category (Fashion, Tech, Fitness, etc.) |
| `Follower_Count` | Integer | Total audience size — reach proxy |
| `Engagement_Rate_Pct` | Float | % of audience actively engaging — quality signal |
| `Avg_Comments_Per_Post` | Integer | Depth of audience interaction — community signal |
| `Past_Brand_Collaborations` | Integer | Influencer's commercial experience — reliability proxy |
| `Campaign_Cost_USD` | Float | Total spend on the campaign |
| `Discount_Code_Uses` | Integer | Direct attribution — tracked conversions |
| `Revenue_Generated_USD` | Float | Attributed revenue from the campaign |
| `High_ROI_Campaign` | Target (Yes/No) | Whether campaign delivered high ROI — classification target |

**The core question this pipeline answers:**
> "Given an influencer's profile and campaign budget, will this campaign generate high ROI — and what is the predicted revenue return?"

