**`assign_campaign_alerts(row)` function:**
Returns a pipe-separated string of triggered alert codes, or 'NO_ALERTS':
- `HIGH_ROI_CONFIRMED` — roi_ratio >= 3.0 (celebrate this)
- `STRONG_ENGAGEMENT` — Engagement_Rate_Pct >= 5.0
- `ELITE_AUDIENCE_QUALITY` — audience_quality_score >= 0.7
- `LOW_COST_PER_CONVERSION` — cost_per_discount_use <= $50
- `HIGH_CONVERSION_RATE` — conversion_rate >= 0.5%
- `NEGATIVE_ROI` — roi_ratio < 1.0 (spent more than earned)
- `POOR_ENGAGEMENT` — Engagement_Rate_Pct < 1.0
- `EXPENSIVE_CONVERSIONS` — cost_per_discount_use > $200
- `ZERO_CONVERSIONS` — Discount_Code_Uses == 0
- `INEXPERIENCED_INFLUENCER` — Past_Brand_Collaborations < 2
- `ANOMALOUS_CAMPAIGN` — is_campaign_anomaly == 1

**`assign_partnership_priority(alerts_str)` function:**
- `P1_STRATEGIC_PARTNER` — HIGH_ROI_CONFIRMED + STRONG_ENGAGEMENT or ELITE_AUDIENCE_QUALITY
- `P2_RECOMMENDED` — HIGH_ROI_CONFIRMED or (STRONG_ENGAGEMENT + LOW_COST_PER_CONVERSION)
- `P3_MONITOR` — no critical positives or negatives; mid-range performer
- `P4_REVIEW_REQUIRED` — any of: NEGATIVE_ROI, EXPENSIVE_CONVERSIONS, ZERO_CONVERSIONS
- `P5_DO_NOT_REBOOK` — NEGATIVE_ROI + (POOR_ENGAGEMENT or ZERO_CONVERSIONS)

